  "instance_name": "chattel_slavery",
  "label": "Chattel Slavery",
  "description": "The meme references the historical institution of chattel slavery, where human beings were treated as property and forced into labor. The visual of shackled feet and the text 'i like my slaves' directly invoke this brutal system, which was central to the economies of the Americas and the United States, and caused immense suffering and racial trauma. Understanding this historical context is essential to comprehend the hateful nature of the meme.",
